## Optional

- Each note also exposes Open Graph and Twitter card metadata (`og:url`, `og:title`, `og:description`, `twitter:*`) for link unfurling.
- The HTML view sets `<link rel="canonical">` to the bare URL `https://hackmd.io/@<user>/<slug>`. Always use this canonical form when citing.
- For agents that need the full API + MCP context in one fetch, start at [Developers hub](https://hackmd.io/developers) and follow links to the Developer Portal book and MCP setup guide.
